/P 44 0 R
/E (The proposed venue layout has been thoughtfully designed to ensure smooth visitor movement, optimal audience experience, and maximum sponsor visibility. The outdoor layout features dedicated entry points, sponsor activation zones, exhibition stalls, parking areas, and visitor engagement spaces strategically positioned around the main Puja Hall. The indoor hall layout is organized with a dedicated Puja Area, cultural performance stage, audience seating, and sponsor stall zones, ensuring clear sightlines and seamless crowd flow. Together, these layouts create multiple branding touchpoints, enhance visitor engagement, and provide sponsors with high-visibility locations for brand activation, customer interaction, and lead generation throughout the event.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
